erent testy situations and dynamic environments<br></li><li><strong>Contentious Battle System:</strong> Employ combos, criticals, continuations and other new mechanics to outwit your argumentative opponents!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A Hilarious Insult-\u2018em up in which players must verbally take-out their friends and family in different game modes. Assemble witty insults using different word strings, and employ combos, criticals, continuations and more to battle your opponents both offline and online across multiple devices.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cSo many games attempt humour and wit and fall painfully short of the mark, but Oh\u2026Sir! manages to be outrageously funny without trying too hard\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 GameSpew<br><br>\u201cHours of slanderous and humorous enjoyment await players in this simple to play argument battler.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 TechRaptor<br><br>\u201cObviously, this game is getting my highest recommendation, and I expect to see it on a few end of year lists\u201d<br>5/5 \u2013 Pocket Tactics<br>",
